== Wyrmling forms ==

Wyrmling shapes are [[size modifier|small]] [[polymorph]]s that merge [[item property|properties]] from any [[shield]] in the [[off-hand slot]] and the [[item]]s in the
[[amulet slot|amulet]],
[[belt slot|belt]],
[[boots slot|boots]],
[[cloak slot|cloak]],
[[first ring slot|ri]][[second ring slot|ng]],
[[armor slot|armor]], and
[[helmet slot]]s.
Whether or not the merged properties [[stack]] depends on whether or not those properties would stack when placed on the same item. Typically, this means that only [[regeneration]] will stack.

As with many polymorphs, wyrmling shapes can override the character's [[strength]], [[dexterity]], and [[constitution]], as well as provide [[temporary hit point]]s, a new [[armor class]], and [[natural weapon]]s. There are five wyrmling types available through this feat, each associated with an element. This element is reflected in their breath weapon (with unlimited uses) and their damage [[immunity]] and [[vulnerability]].
